.TH AURA 1 "2026" "A.U.R.A. v0.6.0-alpha.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aura \- Adaptive Underworld Recon Array (A.U.R.A.) EVE Online tactical AI assistant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aura
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Adaptive Underworld Recon Array (A.U.R.A.)
is an Angel Cartel themed EVE Online tactical companion featuring a local GGUF
language model neural core, a Live Intel Radar, D\-Scan and fleet composition
analysis, a fitting laboratory, wormhole mapping, and XMPP / Mumble VOIP
integration.
.PP
The application source is installed under
.I /opt/aura
and per\-user runtime state (logs, model weights) is stored under
.IR ~/.local/share/aura
following the FreeDesktop XDG Base Directory specification.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AURA_APP_ROOT
Override the installation directory (default
.IR /opt/aura ).
.TP
.B AURA_DATA_DIR
Override the per\-user data directory (default
.IR ~/.local/share/aura ).
.TP
.B AURA_LOG_DIR
Override the log directory.
.TP
.B AURA_MODEL_DIR
Override the GGUF model weights directory.
.TP
.B QT_QPA_PLATFORM
Qt platform plugin selection
.IR ( wayland;xcb
or
.IR xcb ).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /opt/aura
Application source tree.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/aura/logs
Runtime and crash logs.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/aura/models
Local GGUF neural weights.
